        "Speaker": {
          "type": "cexostring",
          "value": ""
        },
        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "*He takes the reliquary back and cups it, the ember flaring warm.* Fifteen levels, and the Fire burns steady in you now -- I knew the calling. An ember kept is a beginning; a priest should carry the Flame in his hand. Let me kindle what you have tended into a mace for you. Shall it be done?"
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "__struct_id": 5,
        "Animation": {
          "type": "dword",
          "value": 0
        },
        "AnimLoop": {
          "type": "byte",
          "value": 1
