        },
        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "*Aldamir presses a small silver censer on a chain into your hand, a single ember glowing within.* Taken up, then. The Acolyte's Censer-Amulet -- wear it, and let it steady your young heart to the calling. Go and grow deep; come back at your eighth level and I will trust you with the real work."
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "__struct_id": 8,
        "Animation": {
          "type": "dword",
