          "value": ""
        },
        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "*He sets the warded reliquary gently into your pack himself.* Carry it well, and carry it close. The Flame keeps faith with the heart that never lets it dim -- come back at fifteen and we shall see it made into something to carry in the hand."
          }
        }
      },
