        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "*The mace is kindled and finished: pale steel, its censer-head warm with the Secret Fire.* There -- the Mace of the Kindled Flame. No greater consecration is set upon it yet; the aura of Narya and the gifts of the full Flame are for a far greater day, when your calling comes into its full. You have walked the first of the priest's road. Keep to the Fire, my friend."
          }
        }
      }
